stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Loading: open editor
    Loading --> Ready: preview hydrated
    Loading --> PreviewError: preview failed
    Ready --> Ready: change draft / switch state
    Ready --> Saving: save
    Saving --> Saved: persistence success
    Saving --> SaveError: persistence failure
    SaveError --> Saving: retry save
    Saved --> Ready: continue editing
    Ready --> ResetConfirm: reset defaults
    ResetConfirm --> Ready: confirm
    ResetConfirm --> Ready: dismiss
    Ready --> Closed: cancel / close
    Saved --> Closed: close
    PreviewError --> Ready: retry / continue editing

    state Ready {
      [*] --> SuccessPreview
      SuccessPreview --> LoadingPreview: inspect loading
      LoadingPreview --> EmptyPreview: inspect empty
      EmptyPreview --> ErrorPreview: inspect error
      ErrorPreview --> DisabledPreview: inspect disabled
      DisabledPreview --> SuccessPreview: inspect ready
    }
